TASK
Write an affiliate product page for {{product_name}}.
Retailer URL: {{product_url}}
Selected size, color, ship-from location and destination: {{selected_variant}}
Listing/review research with timestamps: {{product_research}}
Documented physical testing, if any: {{testing_record}}
Approved affiliate disclosure: {{approved_affiliate_disclosure}}

Make clear that the purchase is completed with the named retailer. Use a clear disclosure before the first commercial recommendation and a CTA such as 'View on AliExpress'. Do not imply that Wow Fashion handles the order, shipping, return or warranty. Do not invent an affiliate URL or tracking parameter.

Write a concise product title and a 50-80 word overview focused on the garment's most useful attributes. Give a short 'Why consider it' section and a balanced 'Check before you buy' section. Include a specification table with verified composition, dimensions/size range, garment features, current price and currency where supplied, store identity, and source-check date. If a value is unknown, omit it from promotional copy and flag it internally.

Separate seller-stated facts, summarized customer feedback and first-hand testing. If no test record exists, state that the assessment is based on listing information and reviewed customer feedback; never use 'we wore', 'we tested', 'our favorite after testing' or equivalent. Summarize review patterns with the actual sample size, period and variant limitations. Do not publish invented quotations or an unsupported star rating.

Recommend a specific use case only when the evidence supports it, and identify an alternative type of garment where useful. Add product-specific sizing advice based on the supplied chart; do not equate a seller's size label with a universal US/UK/EU size. If price is shown, identify the exact variant and whether shipping or tax is included. Tell shoppers to check the retailer's current terms without promising a fixed return window.

Return 250-450 words plus specifications, metadata and a source ledger. Do not fill the word range with unsupported claims.

