TASK
Write a direct-retail product page for {{product_name}} using:
SKU and live variants: {{sku_and_variants}}
Verified product details: {{verified_specifications}}
Sample/testing report: {{sample_report}}
The exact garment size chart: {{size_chart}}
Current approved Wow Fashion policies: {{approved_retail_policies}}

Proceed with checkout language only if the commercial mode confirms that Wow Fashion is the retailer. If the model is affiliate or undecided, flag the mismatch and provide a neutral product description instead.

Write a clear garment title, a 40-70 word short description and three to five factual benefit bullets. Each benefit must be tied to a known feature. Follow with a 120-200 word description covering silhouette, construction, styling options and practical limitations. Avoid a long supplier title full of keywords or a close paraphrase of supplier copy.

Provide a structured specification table for fiber composition, lining, closure, pockets, stretch, dimensions, color, care and country of manufacture where verified. Do not infer any of those details from an image alone. Distinguish composition from weave and finish. Use the care label or verified manufacturer instruction for care advice; leave absent information for review.

Explain how to use the supplied chart and identify whether measurements refer to the body or the garment. Preserve units and tolerances and show accurate conversions only where useful. Do not promise a universal fit or automatically advise sizing up. State stock, shipping, return and price details only from current approved operational data, never from the old site's wording or an unrelated AliExpress listing.

Return the copy, SEO title and meta description, proposed image alt text based on provided images, and a list of missing fields that must be resolved before publication. Make sample-based claims only within the sample's tested variant and conditions.

