TASK
Optimize the metadata and headings for:
URL: {{page_url}}
Page type: {{page_type}}
Current or approved copy: {{page_copy}}
Primary intent and query cluster: {{primary_intent}}
Existing metadata: {{existing_metadata}}

Identify the single primary purpose of the page before writing. Produce three distinct title options and one recommended meta description. Use the main topic naturally, and include 'Wow Fashion' where it fits without truncating the useful description. Aim for roughly 50-60 title characters and 140-160 description characters as editorial guides; report actual counts and do not imply fixed display limits or guaranteed CTR/rankings.

Use plain, specific language. Do not add 'best', 'free shipping', 'official', price, discount, product count or a year unless the page and current evidence support it. Distinguish a category page from a review or buying guide so the snippet does not promise the wrong experience.

